## 2. beautiful-html-templates — Zara Zhang

- Source: https://github.com/zarazhangrui/beautiful-html-templates
- License: MIT
- Copyright (c) 2025 Zara Zhang

**What is derived from it:**

The 34 design systems under `template-pack/templates/` (`design.md` and
`preview.md` for each), plus `template-pack/selection-index.json` and
`template-pack/README.md`.

Modifications: the demo `template.html` files are not bundled; internal path
references in `selection-index.json` were rewritten from `bold-template-pack/`
to `template-pack/`; and the pack's layout policy block was changed from a
fixed 1920×1080 landscape stage to this skill's portrait-first default.
The design-system documents themselves are unchanged.

